WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.363
In Groundwork 2.0, you can build your own reports. Everything here belongs to a made-up sample household.

2
00:00:08.613 --> 00:00:11.578
It starts at the top of Reports, with Build a report.

3
00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:19.084
Say what you want to see, in your own words. Groundwork puts the sections together, even with the AI turned off.

4
00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:27.401
Each section is monthly totals, a trend, a list, a snapshot, a comparison or a what-if, over any period you name.

5
00:00:28.251 --> 00:00:33.712
Every figure is worked out by Groundwork, from your own records. The AI never does the math.

6
00:00:34.562 --> 00:00:41.197
Pick one of six styles: text and grid, text and charts, charts first, text only, compact, or print-ready.

7
00:00:42.047 --> 00:00:47.295
A comparison lines up the two periods you name, line by line, with the change for each.

8
00:00:48.145 --> 00:00:54.588
And when your records can't answer, the section says so plainly, instead of showing a number it can't stand behind.

9
00:00:55.438 --> 00:01:00.643
Save a report, and next month it's ready again. Print it, or save it as a PDF.

10
00:01:01.743 --> 00:01:07.546
Every figure, from your own records. With the AI on or off. Groundwork 2.0 is free.
